## Key Design Decisions
1. Principles are FROZEN (immutable axioms, not learned)
2. Two-pass architecture: Pass 1 filters scope, Pass 2 evaluates with facts
3. LLM used ONLY for fact extraction (not reasoning)
4. Integration is ADDITIVE (existing pipeline unchanged)
5. Target repo: `master_investments` (NOT _mmo)
